## Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
npm run infra:up          # start docker services
{{/if}}
npm install
{{#if ormPrisma}}
npm run prisma:migrate    # create the database schema
{{/if}}
npm run start:dev
```

